00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:00,885
A trap.

2
00:00:00,885 --> 00:00:08,802
The silver half reaction had to be doubled to balance two electrons, but its E nought stays plus zero point eight zero.

3
00:00:08,802 --> 00:00:15,442
Electrode potential is energy per unit charge, so it does not depend on how much reaction you write.

4
00:00:15,442 --> 00:00:19,075
Only delta G scales with the number of electrons.

